OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a frosty start most areas
OL,6,Fwill stay dry with some good spells of
OL,7,Fsunshine the best of this across
OL,8,Fwestern areas and the Isles. Caithness
OL,9,Fand Sutherland could have the odd
OL,10,Flight shower this morning. Breezy over
OL,11,FOuter Hebrides.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FIt will be a dry evening and
OL,14,Fnight with mostly clear skies. Frost
OL,15,Fwill become widespread on the
OL,16,Fmainland, severe in places, while the
OL,17,FIsles will be milder through windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
