OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAnother dry day with some long
OL,6,Fsunny spells for most though the Isles
OL,7,Fwill turn cloudier later. The Isles
OL,8,Falso windy, but lighter winds and
OL,9,Ffrost early and late inland.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain
OL,12,Fspreading east on Tuesday with snow on
OL,13,Fhigher ground for a time. Patchy rain
OL,14,Fon Wednesday then mainly dry on
OL,15,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
